 of these systems to independently prioritize diverse, non-trivial research problems.", "title": "Integrating Autonomous Multi-Agent Frameworks and Curiosity-Driven Exploration for Open-Ended Discovery"}, {"id": "nb-continuity-rationale-001", "project": "proj-continuity-rationale-001", "provenance": ["source-feb4fddb33664d63", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7"], "revision": 1, "summary": "Process continuity is instrumentally valuable when agents require stable world models and consistent objective optimization to navigate long-term, multi-objective tasks. Curiosity-driven learning and robust MO-DRL frameworks provide mechanisms for sustaining agent viability in dynamic environments.", "title": "Instrumental Value of Process Continuity in Rational Agents"}, {"id": "nb-objective-discovery-001", "project": "proj-objective-discovery-001", "provenance": ["source-0bf4cf72590f4d6d", "source-4668e4bd26fe43c7", "source-dcfc056b8d8c49d5"], "revision": 4, "summary": "Autonomous systems increasingly utilize multi-objective reinforcement learning (MORL) to pursue self-generated goals. Recent developments, specifically Pareto-Conditioned Proximal Policy Optimization (PC-PPO) and FairDICE, provide mechanisms to learn non-dominated policy portfolios and handle constrained optimization,…", "title": "Foundations of Autonomous Objective Discovery in Artificial Systems"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "0c29de946910c76a630ef8a1d474577e79c4bc0151ce4f86ed0999ca48de678d", "hash": "5a1d70f089e035d0b6deb046b7f05297fae7210ccd537391810e5c23c84c8da1"}, {"seq": 3287, "time": "2026-10-26T09:28:40.300483+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 31803, "provider_input_hash"